   - `jackioh golden check --seed`
   - `jackioh promote --lane learn`
   - `jackioh spec --root`
   - `jackioh trace --series`

   Each one reads `… is in no row of the table`.

7. **Edit `crates/tools/README.md`.** Each match below must be unique.
   - **Line 17:** replace ``| `trace [matchup] [n] [full]` | `trace.rs` | one AI gate game, turn by turn |`` with ``| `trace [matchup] [n] [full] [--series s]` | `trace.rs` | one AI gate game, turn by turn, from the tuning series (`AI_TUNING_SERIES`; `--series`, or `SERIES`, names another) |``.
   - **Line 37, first cell:** replace ``| `golden check`, `golden bless` |`` with ``| `golden check [--file <path>] [--seed K]…`, `golden bless [--seeds N] [--file <path>]` |``.
   - **Line 37, Does cell:** replace `; `bless` rewrites them, only after an intended rules change |` with `; `--file` replays another trace file and `--seed` (repeatable) only that seed; `bless` rewrites them, only after an intended rules change: plain seeds 1..=N (`--seeds`, at most 200, default 200) and handicapped seeds 201..=200+N/5, into `--file` when it is given |`.
   - **Line 42:** replace ``| `spec check`, `spec index` |`` with ``| `spec [--root <dir>] check`, `spec [--root <dir>] index` |``.
   - **Line 47, first cell:** replace `` `promote --lane improve\|unban --parent-bin `` with `` `promote --lane improve\|unban\|learn --parent-bin ``.
